WEBVTT

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.840
as he went off to fight
in the Kentucky Colored Regiment,

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.840
the Civil War.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.776
They were born slaves
but they wouldn't die slaves.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.696
Change-making, it's in my blood.

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:09.976
It's what I do,

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:14.560
and this health crisis ain't nothing
compared to the road we have traveled.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:18.560
(Applause)

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.336
So it's like James Cleveland.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:24.896
I don't feel no ways tired,
so we got to work.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.976
We started looking at models of change.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.416
We looked all over the world.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.656
We needed something

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.816
not only that was a part
of our cultural inheritance like walking,